/* 消息详情（Figma 670:3155）：像一封短信——小标签、宋体标题、来源、细线、正文段落；下方核对卡、边界脚注与返回。 */
.detail-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.detail-letter {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.detail-head {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12rpx;
}

.detail-kicker {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.detail-title {
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.detail-body {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.detail-letter--withdrawn .detail-title,
.detail-letter--withdrawn .detail-body {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
}

/* 测试要求保留 safe-outline-button return-action 类名；外观按 P3 Secondary 覆盖 */
.return-action {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 100%;
  height: var(--p3-button);
  min-height: var(--p3-button);
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 32rpx;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-pill);
  background: transparent;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2rpx var(--p3-control);
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 32rpx;
  line-height: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}
